1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:15,710
We have just disembarked so disembarking is like getting off the ferry basically and now we are here.
我们刚下船。disembarking 基本上就是从渡轮上下来，现在我们到啦。

2
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:27,000
The plan now is to get some lunch so we are going to get lunch in a nearby village.
现在计划去吃午饭，我们要去附近一个村子里吃。

3
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:37,400
We are going to walk um down by the harbor until we find a cafe that is the plan.
我们打算沿着港口那边走，找到咖啡馆为止，这就是计划。

4
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:53,590
So there's a small cottage down there and this red windmill this windmill was built in the 1800 s that's amazing.
下面有一间小屋，还有这座红色风车。这个风车建于十九世纪，真了不起。

5
00:00:53,600 --> 00:01:07,390
The windmill is behind me but if you go if you go up these rocks you can see the port as well.
风车在我后面，不过爬上这些岩石，也能看到港口。

6
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:12,680
Oops oh my god it's so slippery I need to be careful.
哎呀，天哪，太滑了，我得小心点。

7
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:29,230
Okay something interesting about Sweden is it is the country with the most islands in the world so we are going to explore one of of islands today.
瑞典有个有趣之处：它是世界上岛屿数量最多的国家。今天我们就要探索其中一座。

8
00:01:29,240 --> 00:01:39,830
But really peaceful you can see there's not many people here and there's a small harbor.
这里很宁静，你能看到没什么人，还有一个小港口。

9
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:49,110
You can see the harbor wall I can zoom in here is the harbor wall as well.
可以看到港口堤墙，我放大一下，这里也能看到。

10
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:58,440
To get to the village with the cafe we had to walk around the coast so on the coast path.
要去那个有咖啡馆的村子，我们得沿着海岸走，也就是走海岸步道。

11
00:01:58,440 --> 00:02:13,430
But laughter there was no like obvious trail so I need to be careful because this is the foot path.
不过这里没有很明显的路线，我得小心，因为这就是步道。

12
00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:18,430
Okay I need to watch my step.
好，我得看好脚下。

13
00:02:18,440 --> 00:02:29,400
We often had to guess where we were going and for the whole journey we were following these blue dots.
我们经常只能猜方向，整个路程都在跟着这些蓝点走。

14
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:33,000
Following these like blue dots can you see.
就是跟着这些蓝点，你们能看到吗？

15
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:42,790
They were kind of like checkpoints in a video game um so that was quite fun.
它们有点像电子游戏里的检查点，还挺有意思的。

16
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:53,750
Okay and one more yeah I mean it's really beautiful the nature is super wild.
好，再来一个。这里真的很美，自然景观特别原始。

17
00:02:53,760 --> 00:03:06,320
But look at this park here is this huge rock and then behind us is the sea it's amazing.
再看这里这块巨大的岩石，后面就是海，太棒了。

18
00:03:06,320 --> 00:03:10,800
I have never been to one of these islands before.
我以前从没来过这些岛中的任何一个。

19
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:24,910
It was a really amazing walk like we passed docks and beaches and houses and ice everything.
这一路真的很棒，经过了码头、沙滩、房子、冰，什么都有。

20
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:35,040
And it was really amazing um obviously my microphone like my mic wasn't working as usual whatever.
确实很棒，不过我的麦克风又一如既往地没正常工作，算啦。

21
00:03:36,320 --> 00:03:43,990
But eventually we made it to the place where we were having lunch.
不过，我们最后还是到了准备吃午饭的地方。

22
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:53,750
You can tell that it's cold look at the duck so cute.
看得出来天气很冷。看看这只鸭子，多可爱。

23
00:03:53,760 --> 00:04:00,510
We arrived at the place we were having lunch and we decided to go to one of the cafes.
到了午餐地点，我们决定选其中一家咖啡馆。

24
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:14,800
And right as my food arrived right as my food came my phone died so I had to ask the girl at the bar if she could charge my phone for me.
结果食物刚端上来，我手机就没电了，只能问吧台那位姑娘能不能帮我给手机充电。
